  "TECHNICAL Mastery": "",
  "Additional effects activated via TECHNICAL. For every $1 TECHNICAL Mastery, gain the following effects (gain proportional effects when below $2).\\nIncrease the Skill Damage buff from [Backdraft] by $3.\\nIncrease the Skill Damage buff from [Frigid Bolt] by $4.\\nIncrease the Fire/Ice DMG Taken from [Ice Burn] by $5.\\nIncrease the bonus damage from [Hurricane Flame] by $6.\\nIncrease the base chance of [Ice Seal] by $7.": "",
  "Fire Containment": "",
  "{{A}}'s skills can activate Ice TECHNICAL. At the start of Natsukawa's turn, gain $1 [Extinguishing Power] stack. Stacks up to $2 times. Spend [Extinguishing Power] when using [Bursting Waterfall], each $3 [Extinguishing Power] stacks spent will inflict all foes with $4 [Drowning] stack.\\n[Drowning]: Increase DMG Taken by $5 for $6 turns. Stacks up to $7 times.\\nWhen Natsukawa deals Ice damage, ignore foes' [Resist] affinity.": "",
  "Firefighting Unit": "",
  "Additionally gain $1 [Extinguishing Power] when using [Echoing Tide]; Increase all foes' Crit DMG Taken by $2 when spending [Extinguishing Power] for $3 turns.": "",
  "Border Guardian": "",
  "When spending [Extinguishing Power], increase all Thieves' ATK by $1, DEF by $2, and DMG Dealt by $3 for $4 turns.": "",
  "Cut Off the Smoke": "",
  "Calm the Flame": "",
  "HIGHLIGHT Enhanced: Extends the DMG Taken duration from HIGHLIGHT by $1 turn; Increase the base chance of <link\\=\"s|231\"><u>[Ice Seal]</u></link> to $2 when HIGHLIGHT triggers <link\\=\"s|231\"><u>[Ice Seal]</u></link>.": "",
  "Seven Principles": "",
  "Flower of Edo": "",
  "At the start of {{A}}'s turn, if any foe is inflicted with any Burn, immediately use [Echoing Tide] with them as the main target ([Fading Flame] can activate this effect).\\nWhen using [Bursting Waterfall]/[Bursting Tornado] to attack the same target, additionally increase the target's DMG Taken by $1 for $2 turn.\\nIncrease the maximum stacks of [Drowning] to $3 stacks.": "",
  "Gain $1 [Extinguishing Power] stack, and deal Ice damage to <color\\=#FFFF00>all</color> foes equal to $2 of ATK, with a $3 base chance to inflict Freeze and decrease DEF by $4 for $8 turns (for every $5 of Natsukawa's Ailment ACC, decrease DEF by $6 more, up to a maximum of $7). When an ally attacks a foe with this effect, increase TECHNICAL Mastery by $9. If at least 1 foe is inflicted with Burn, remove their Burn and inflict [Fading Flame] on all foes ([Fading Flame] cannot activate this effect).\\n[Fading Flame]: Counts as Burn. Lasts for $10 turns. When allies attack the affected foe, increase TECHNICAL Mastery by $11.": "",
  "Gain $1 [Extinguishing Power] stack, and deal Ice damage to <color\\=#FFFF00>all</color> foes equal to $2 of ATK, with a $3 base chance to inflict Freeze and decrease DEF by $4 for $8 turns (for every $5 of Natsukawa's Ailment ACC, decrease DEF by $6 more, up to a maximum of $7). When an ally attacks a foe with this effect, increase TECHNICAL Mastery by $9. If at least 1 foe is inflicted with Burn, remove their Burn and inflict [Fading Flame] on all foes.\\n[Fading Flame]: Counts as Burn. Lasts for $10 turns. When allies attack the affected foe, increase TECHNICAL Mastery by $11.": "",
  "Gain $1 [Extinguishing Power] stack, and deal Ice damage to all foes equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> of ATK, with a $3 base chance to inflict <link\\=\"s|103\"><u>Freeze</u></link> and decrease DEF by <color\\=#FFFC40>$4</color> for $8 turns (for every $5 of Natsukawa's Ailment ACC, decrease DEF by $6 more, up to a maximum of <color\\=#FFFC40>$7</color>). When an ally attacks a foe with this effect, increase TECHNICAL Mastery by <color\\=#FFFC40>$9</color>. If at least 1 foe is inflicted with <link\\=\"s|102\"><u>Burn</u></link>, remove their <link\\=\"s|102\"><u>Burn</u></link> and inflict [Fading Flame] on all foes ([Fading Flame] cannot activate this effect).\\n[Fading Flame]: Counts as <link\\=\"s|102\"><u>Burn</u></link>. Lasts for $10 turns. When allies attack the affected foe, increase <link\\=\"s|233\"><u>TECHNICAL Mastery</u></link> by <color\\=#FFFC40>$11</color>.": "",
  "Deal Ice damage to <color\\=#FFFF00>1</color> foe equal to $1 of ATK, and can activate Ice TECHNICAL. When [Ice Seal] is activated, increase [Ice Seal] base chance to $2.": "",
  "Deal Ice damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK, and can activate <link\\=\"s|229\"><u>Ice TECHNICAL</u></link>. When <link\\=\"s|231\"><u>[Ice Seal]</u></link> is activated, increase <link\\=\"s|231\"><u>[Ice Seal]</u></link> base chance to <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color>.": "",
  "Spend $1 [Extinguishing Power] stacks to deal Ice damage to <color\\=#FFFF00>all</color> foes equal to $2 of ATK. Decrease DEF by $3 for $7 turns (for every $4 of Natsukawa's Ailment ACC, decrease DEF by $5 more, up to a maximum of $6). Also activate Ice TECHNICAL. When [Ice Burn] is activated, this effect is guaranteed to evolve to [Cold Flames].\\n[Cold Flames]: Increase DMG Taken by $8 (for every $9 of Natsukawa's Ailment ACC, increase DMG Taken by $10 more, up to a maximum of $11).": "",
  "Can be used at $1 or more [Extinguishing Power] stacks.\\nSpend $2 [Extinguishing Power] stacks to deal Ice damage to all foes equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$3</color> of ATK. Decrease DEF by <color\\=#FFFC40>$4</color> for $8 turns (for every $5 of Natsukawa's Ailment ACC, decrease DEF by $6 more, up to a maximum of <color\\=#FFFC40>$7</color>). Also activate <link\\=\"s|229\"><u>Ice TECHNICAL</u></link>. When <link\\=\"s|227\"><u>[Ice Burn]</u></link> is activated, this effect is guaranteed to evolve to [Cold Flames].\\n[Cold Flames]: Increase DMG Taken by <color\\=#FFFC40>$9</color> (for every $10 of Natsukawa's Ailment ACC, increase DMG Taken by $11 more, up to a maximum of <color\\=#FFFC40>$12</color>).\\nAt $13 or more [Extinguishing Power] stacks, evolve this skill to [Bursting Tornado].\\n[Bursting Tornado]: Spend $14 [Extinguishing Power] stacks to deal Ice damage to all foes equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$15</color> of ATK. Decrease DEF by <color\\=#FFFC40>$16</color> for $20 turns (for every $17 of Natsukawa's Ailment ACC, decrease DEF by $18 more, up to a maximum of <color\\=#FFFC40>$19</color>). Also activate <link\\=\"s|229\"><u>Ice TECHNICAL</u></link>. When <link\\=\"s|227\"><u>[Ice Burn]</u></link> is activated, this effect is guaranteed to evolve to [Cold Flames].\\n[Cold Flames]: Increase DMG Taken by <color\\=#FFFC40>$21</color> (for every $22 of Natsukawa's Ailment ACC, increase DMG Taken by $23 more, up to a maximum of <color\\=#FFFC40>$24</color>).": "",
  "Spend $1 [Extinguishing Power] stacks to deal Ice damage to all foes equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> of ATK. Decrease DEF by <color\\=#FFFC40>$3</color> for $7 turns (for every $4 of Natsukawa's Ailment ACC, decrease DEF by $5 more, up to a maximum of <color\\=#FFFC40>$6</color>). Also activate <link\\=\"s|229\"><u>Ice TECHNICAL</u></link>. When <link\\=\"s|227\"><u>[Ice Burn]</u></link> is activated, this effect is guaranteed to evolve to [Cold Flames].\\n[Cold Flames]: Increase DMG Taken by <color\\=#FFFC40>$8</color> (for every $9 of Natsukawa's Ailment ACC, increase DMG Taken by $10 more, up to a maximum of <color\\=#FFFC40>$11</color>).": "",
